---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="About — Netkuki">
	<main class="inner-page about-page">
		<p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> A NOTE ABOUT THIS PLACE</p>
		<h1 class="inner-title">An internet home,<br /><span>made with intention.</span></h1>
		<p class="inner-lede">Netkuki is a personal blog and portfolio: a small, independent space to make things, learn in public, and share what feels worth passing along.</p>
		<div class="about-grid">
			<div class="about-block"><span class="note-number">THE APPROACH</span><h2>Simple on purpose.</h2><p>Fast pages, clear writing, and a little room for curiosity. This site is built with Astro and hosted on Cloudflare Pages, with the open web in mind.</p></div>
			<div class="about-block"><span class="note-number">THE TOOLKIT</span><h2>Good tools, used thoughtfully.</h2><p>Astro, TypeScript, and a lightweight design system keep things quick and easy to evolve as the site grows.</p></div>
		</div>
		<a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to the beginning</a>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>
